#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:1
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_ThisMoveCanOnlyBeLearnedOnce"
msgid ""
"This move can be learned only\n"
"once. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""
"这个招式只能学习一次。\n"
"可以吗？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:5
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_SwaggerTeach"
msgid ""
"Heh! My POKéMON totally rules!\n"
"It's cooler than any POKéMON!\p"
"I was lipping off with a swagger in\n"
"my step like that when the CHAIRMAN\l"
"chewed me out.\p"
"That took the swagger out of my step.\p"
"If you'd like, I'll teach the move\n"
"SWAGGER to a POKéMON of yours.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿！我的宝可梦超厉害的！\n"
"比任何宝可梦都要酷！\p"
"我就这样大摇大摆地吹牛，\n"
"结果被会长狠狠地骂了一顿。\p"
"这下我再也神气不起来了。\p"
"如果你愿意的话，我可以教你的\n"
"宝可梦“虚张声势”这个招式。$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:15
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_SwaggerDeclined"
msgid ""
"What, no? Can't you get into\n"
"the spirit of things?$"
msgstr ""
"什么，不要？\n"
"你就不能配合一下气氛吗？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:19
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_SwaggerWhichMon"
msgid ""
"All right, which POKéMON wants to\n"
"learn how to SWAGGER?$"
msgstr ""
"好吧，哪只宝可梦\n"
"想学习虚张声势？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:23
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_SwaggerTaught"
msgid ""
"I'll just praise my POKéMON from now\n"
"on without the swagger.$"
msgstr ""
"从今以后，我夸奖自己的宝可梦时\n"
"再也不会虚张声势了。$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:27
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_RolloutTeach"
msgid ""
"Did you know that you can go from\n"
"here a long way in that direction\l"
"without changing direction?\p"
"I might even be able to roll\n"
"that way.\p"
"Do you think your POKéMON will\n"
"want to roll, too?\p"
"I can teach one the move ROLLOUT\n"
"if you'd like.$"
msgstr ""
"你知道吗？从这里往那个方向，\n"
"可以一直走很远很远，\l"
"完全不用转弯哦。\p"
"说不定我还能一路滚过去呢。\p"
"你觉得你的宝可梦\n"
"也会想要滚一滚吗？\p"
"如果你愿意的话，\n"
"我可以教它“滚动”这个招式。$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:38
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_RolloutDeclined"
msgid ""
"You don't need to be shy about it.\n"
"Let's roll!$"
msgstr ""
"不用害羞嘛。\n"
"一起滚吧！$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:42
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_RolloutWhichMon"
msgid ""
"Ehehe, sure thing! It'd be great if\n"
"the POKéMON looked like me.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿嘿，没问题！要是那只宝可梦\n"
"长得像我就好了。$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:46
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_RolloutTaught"
msgid ""
"Rolling around in the grass makes me\n"
"happy. Come on, let's roll!$"
msgstr ""
"在草地上滚来滚去\n"
"让我好开心。来，一起滚吧！$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:50
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_FuryCutterTeach"
msgid ""
"There's a move that gets stronger\n"
"when you keep using it in a row.\p"
"It's a BUG-type move, and it is\n"
"wickedly cool.\p"
"It's called FURY CUTTER.\n"
"Want me to teach it to a POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""
"有一种招式，连续使用的话\n"
"威力会越来越强。\p"
"它是虫属性的招式，\n"
"而且超级酷。\p"
"它叫“连斩”。\n"
"要我教给你的宝可梦吗？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:58
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_FuryCutterDeclined"
msgid "We're not on the same wavelength.$"
msgstr "看来我们合不来啊。$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:61
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_FuryCutterWhichMon"
msgid ""
"Yay!\n"
"Show me which POKéMON I should teach.$"
msgstr ""
"耶！\n"
"让我看看要教哪只宝可梦吧。$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:65
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_FuryCutterTaught"
msgid ""
"I get a thrill watching to see if\n"
"the move keeps hitting in succession!$"
msgstr ""
"看着招式能不能连续命中，\n"
"真是让我兴奋不已！$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:69
msgctxt "MoveTutor_MimicTeach"
msgid ""
"Ah, young one!\p"
"I am also a young one, but I mimic\n"
"the styles and speech of the elderly\l"
"folks of this town.\p"
"What do you say, young one?\n"
"Would you agree to it if I were to\l"
"offer to teach the move MIMIC?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，年轻人！\p"
"我也还是个年轻人，不过我在模仿\n"
"这个镇上老人家的打扮和说话方式。\p"
"怎么样，年轻人？\n"
"如果我提出要教你\l"
"“模仿”这个招式，你会同意吗？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:78
msgctxt "MoveTutor_MimicDeclined"
msgid ""
"Oh, boo! I wanted to teach MIMIC\n"
"to your POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，真扫兴！我本来想把模仿\n"
"教给你的宝可梦的！$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:82
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_MimicWhichMon"
msgid ""
"Fwofwo! And so I shall!\n"
"Let me see the POKéMON\l"
"you wish me to teach.$"
msgstr ""
"呼哦呼哦！那就这么办吧！\n"
"让我看看你想让我\l"
"教哪只宝可梦。$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:87
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_MimicTaught"
msgid ""
"MIMIC is a move of great depth.\p"
"Could you execute it to perfection\n"
"as well as me…?$"
msgstr ""
"模仿是一个很有深度的招式。\p"
"你能像我一样\n"
"把它用得完美无缺吗……？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:92
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_MetronomeTeach"
msgid ""
"I want all sorts of things!\n"
"But I used up my allowance…\p"
"Wouldn't it be nice if there were\n"
"a spell that made money appear when\l"
"you waggle a finger?\p"
"If you want, I can teach your POKéMON\n"
"the move METRONOME.\p"
"Money won't appear, but your POKéMON\n"
"will waggle a finger. Yes?$"
msgstr ""
"我想要好多好多东西！\n"
"可是零用钱已经花光了……\p"
"要是有一种咒语，只要挥挥手指\n"
"就能变出钱来，那该多好啊！\p"
"如果你愿意的话，我可以教你的\n"
"宝可梦“挥指”这个招式。\p"
"虽然变不出钱来，但你的宝可梦\n"
"会挥动手指哦。好吗？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:103
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_MetronomeDeclined"
msgid ""
"Okay. I'll be here if you change\n"
"your mind.$"
msgstr ""
"好吧。如果改变主意了，\n"
"我就在这里等你。$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:107
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_MetronomeWhichMon"
msgid ""
"Okay! I'll teach it!\n"
"Which POKéMON should I teach?$"
msgstr ""
"好！我来教你！\n"
"要教哪只宝可梦呢？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:111
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_MetronomeTaught"
msgid ""
"When a POKéMON waggles its finger\n"
"like a METRONOME, all sorts of nice\l"
"things happen.\p"
"Wouldn't it be nice if we could\n"
"use it, too?$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦像节拍器一样挥动手指时，\n"
"会发生各种各样的好事。\p"
"要是我们也能用就好了。$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:118
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_SleepTalkTeach"
msgid ""
"Humph! My wife relies on HIDDEN\n"
"POWER to stay awake.\p"
"She should just take a nap like I do,\n"
"and SLEEP TALK.\p"
"I can teach your POKéMON how to\n"
"SLEEP TALK instead. Interested?$"
msgstr ""
"哼！我老婆靠觉醒力量\n"
"来保持清醒。\p"
"她应该像我一样，\n"
"打个盹儿说说梦话就好了。\p"
"我可以教你的宝可梦\n"
"“梦话”这个招式。有兴趣吗？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:126
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_SleepTalkDeclined"
msgid ""
"Oh, fine, fine. You want to stay awake\n"
"with HIDDEN POWER, too…$"
msgstr ""
"哦，好吧，好吧。你也想\n"
"靠觉醒力量保持清醒啊……$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:130
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_SleepTalkWhichMon"
msgid ""
"Ah, an appreciative child!\n"
"Which POKéMON should I teach?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，真是个懂事的孩子！\n"
"要教哪只宝可梦呢？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:134
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_SleepTalkTaught"
msgid ""
"I've never once gotten my wife's\n"
"coin trick right.\p"
"I would be happy if I got it right\n"
"even as I SLEEP TALK…$"
msgstr ""
"我老婆的硬币戏法，\n"
"我一次都没成功过。\p"
"要是说梦话的时候\n"
"能成功就好了……$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:140
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_SubstituteTeach"
msgid ""
"When I see the wide world from up\n"
"here on the roof…\p"
"I think about how nice it would be\n"
"if there were more than just one me\l"
"so I could enjoy all sorts of lives.\p"
"Of course it's not possible.\n"
"Giggle…\p"
"I know! Would you be interested in\n"
"having a POKéMON learn SUBSTITUTE?$"
msgstr ""
"从屋顶上眺望广阔的世界时……\p"
"我就会想，要是不止一个我，\n"
"能体验各种各样的人生，\l"
"那该多好啊。\p"
"当然，这是不可能的。\n"
"呵呵……\p"
"对了！你想不想\n"
"让宝可梦学会“替身”呢？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:151
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_SubstituteDeclined"
msgid ""
"Oh, no?\p"
"A POKéMON can make a copy of\n"
"itself using it, you know.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，不要吗？\p"
"要知道，宝可梦可以用它\n"
"制造出自己的分身哦。$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:156
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_SubstituteWhichMon"
msgid ""
"Giggle…\n"
"Which POKéMON do you want me to\l"
"teach SUBSTITUTE?$"
msgstr ""
"呵呵……\n"
"你想让我教哪只宝可梦\l"
"学会替身呢？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:161
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_SubstituteTaught"
msgid ""
"We human beings should enjoy our\n"
"own lives to the utmost!\p"
"I hope you'll get that way, too!$"
msgstr ""
"我们人类应该尽情地\n"
"享受自己的人生！\p"
"希望你也能做到！$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:166
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_DynamicPunchTeach"
msgid ""
"I can't do this anymore!\p"
"It's utterly hopeless!\p"
"I'm a FIGHTING-type TRAINER,\n"
"so I can't win at the MOSSDEEP GYM\l"
"no matter how hard I try!\p"
"Argh! Punch! Punch! Punch!\n"
"Punch! Punch! Punch!\p"
"What, don't look at me that way!\n"
"I'm only hitting the ground!\p"
"Or do you want me to teach your\n"
"POKéMON DYNAMICPUNCH?$"
msgstr ""
"我受不了了！\p"
"完全没希望了！\p"
"我是格斗属性的训练家，\n"
"不管怎么努力，\l"
"都赢不了绿岭道馆！\p"
"啊！看拳！看拳！看拳！\n"
"看拳！看拳！看拳！\p"
"什么，别那样看着我！\n"
"我只是在打地面而已！\p"
"还是说，你想让我教你的\n"
"宝可梦“爆裂拳”？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:179
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_DynamicPunchDeclined"
msgid ""
"Darn! You're even making fun of me?\n"
"Punch! Punch! Punch!$"
msgstr ""
"可恶！连你也要取笑我吗？\n"
"看拳！看拳！看拳！$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:183
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_DynamicPunchWhichMon"
msgid ""
"What? You do? You're a good person!\n"
"Which POKéMON should I teach?$"
msgstr ""
"什么？你愿意？你真是个好人！\n"
"要教哪只宝可梦呢？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:187
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_DynamicPunchTaught"
msgid ""
"I want you to win at the MOSSDEEP GYM\n"
"using that DYNAMICPUNCH!$"
msgstr ""
"我希望你用那招爆裂拳\n"
"在绿岭道馆取得胜利！$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:191
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_DoubleEdgeTeach"
msgid ""
"Sigh…\p"
"SOOTOPOLIS's GYM LEADER is really\n"
"lovably admirable.\p"
"But that also means I have many\n"
"rivals for his attention.\p"
"He's got appeal with a DOUBLE-EDGE.\n"
"I couldn't even catch his eye.\p"
"Please, let me teach your POKéMON\n"
"the move DOUBLE-EDGE!$"
msgstr ""
"唉……\p"
"琉璃市的道馆馆主\n"
"真是太令人倾慕了。\p"
"不过，这也意味着\n"
"我有很多情敌。\p"
"他的魅力就像舍身冲撞一样猛烈。\n"
"我却连他的目光都吸引不到。\p"
"拜托了，让我教你的宝可梦\n"
"“舍身冲撞”这个招式吧！$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:202
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_DoubleEdgeDeclined"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"Even you rejected me…$"
msgstr ""
"哦……\n"
"连你也拒绝我……$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:206
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_DoubleEdgeWhichMon"
msgid ""
"Okay, which POKéMON should I teach\n"
"DOUBLE-EDGE?$"
msgstr ""
"好的，要教哪只宝可梦\n"
"舍身冲撞呢？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:210
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_DoubleEdgeTaught"
msgid ""
"I won't live for love anymore!\n"
"I'll become tough!$"
msgstr ""
"我再也不为爱而活了！\n"
"我要变得坚强！$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:214
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_ExplosionTeach"
msgid ""
"I don't intend to be going nowhere\n"
"fast in the sticks like this forever.\p"
"You watch me, I'll get out to the city\n"
"and become a huge hit.\p"
"Seriously, I'm going to cause\n"
"a huge EXPLOSION of popularity!\p"
"If you overheard that, I'll happily\n"
"teach EXPLOSION to your POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"我可不打算一辈子\n"
"窝在这种乡下地方。\p"
"你看着吧，我要去大城市\n"
"闯出一番名堂。\p"
"说真的，我要让人气\n"
"来一场大爆炸！\p"
"既然你听到了，我很乐意\n"
"把“大爆炸”教给你的宝可梦！$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:224
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_ExplosionDeclined"
msgid ""
"Gaah! You're turning me down because\n"
"I live in the country?$"
msgstr ""
"啊啊！你拒绝我，\n"
"是因为我住在乡下吗？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:228
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_ExplosionWhichMon"
msgid ""
"Fine! An EXPLOSION it is!\n"
"Which POKéMON wants to blow up?$"
msgstr ""
"好！就是大爆炸了！\n"
"哪只宝可梦想要爆炸？$"

#: data/text/move_tutors.inc:232
msgctxt "MoveTutor_Text_ExplosionTaught"
msgid ""
"For a long time, I've taught POKéMON\n"
"how to use EXPLOSION, but I've yet\l"
"to ignite my own EXPLOSION…\p"
"Maybe it's because deep down,\n"
"I would rather stay here…$"
msgstr ""
"这么多年来，我一直教宝可梦\n"
"使用大爆炸，可我自己\l"
"却还没能引发大爆炸……\p"
"也许是因为在内心深处，\n"
"我其实更想留在这里吧……$"
